dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄远法师兼柬南浦 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"松云深处敞禅关，草坐麻衣多在山。\n应笑东华尘土客，白头如雪未能閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3775,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄远法师兼柬南浦 其三","author":"杨士奇","text":"文江江上龙华老，一住平坡少出城。\n又是经年不相见，蒲庵新刻几篇成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3776,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题菜","author":"杨士奇","text":"落酥芦菔嘉肥嫩，野老常将拟八珍。\n此日卿家看图画，秋官一味诧清贫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3777,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题脊令图三首 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"白云原上经行日，傍墓曾看草结庐。\n今日都门复相送，绿袍分教赴姑苏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3778,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]